{"tag":"1AB2","body":"<div class=\"pq-q ue-math\"><p>Fix a preference relation <span class=\"katex-lite\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"≿\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.9592em;vertical-align:-0.2296em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">≿</span></span></span></span></span> on <span class=\"m-nb\"><span class=\"katex-lite\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"X\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>.</span> Let <span class=\"katex-lite\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"≻ ≻\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">≻</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≻</span></span></span></span></span></span> (“much preferred”) be a transitive relation contained in <span class=\"m-nb\"><span class=\"katex-lite\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"≻\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≻</span></span></span></span></span>,</span> with this property: <span class=\"katex-lite\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"x ≻ ≻ z\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≻</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"marg